conditions.description:
Optional conditions that must be met for permission to apply
Format: Directus/Strapi style - { "field": { "operator": "value" } }
Example: { "author": { "_eq": "$CURRENT_USER" } }
A value from the caller's member profile: { "Branch": { "_eq": "$CURRENT_USER.branch" } }

get.description:
Superseded by the OFREP routes under /ofrep/v1/evaluate/flags (#628),
which an OpenFeature SDK reads with no client of ours. This route keeps answering through 5.x;
every response names its successor in a Link header.
